---
import { CalendarCheck, FileText, Headset, HeartHandshake, PhoneOutgoing, RotateCcw, Target, Wallet } from "lucide";
import FeatureIcon from "./islands/FeatureIcon";
---
<section id="tarefas" class="px-4 py-20 md:px-6 md:py-24"><div class="mx-auto max-w-[1100px]"><div class="flex flex-col gap-4 md:flex-row md:items-end md:justify-between"><div class="max-w-[560px]"><h2 class="h-section">Dê qualquer tarefa aos lobs</h2><p class="mt-4 text-[16px] leading-[26px] text-muted">Uma turma cobrindo todo o atendimento, do primeiro "oi" ao pagamento confirmado.</p></div><a href="#faq" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[15px] text-zappy-strong hover:underline">Ver todos os usos <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right size-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></a></div><div class="mt-12 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><div class="group rounded-[18px] border border-line bg-surface p-5 transition-[transform,box-shadow] duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_16px_40px_-24px_rgba(31,127,224,0.5)]"><FeatureIcon icon={CalendarCheck} color="blue" id="task-agendamento" class="size-14 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:-rotate-3" /><h3 class="mt-3 text-[16px] font-medium">Agendamento</h3><p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-[22px] text-muted">Marca, remarca e confirma horários direto na sua agenda.</p></div><div class="group rounded-[18px] border border-line bg-surface p-5 transition-[transform,box-shadow] duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_16px_40px_-24px_rgba(31,127,224,0.5)]"><FeatureIcon icon={FileText} color="orange" id="task-propostas" class="size-14 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:-rotate-3" /><h3 class="mt-3 text-[16px] font-medium">Propostas</h3><p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-[22px] text-muted">Gera e envia propostas em PDF com os seus preços e modelo.</p></div><div class="group rounded-[18px] border border-line bg-surface p-5 transition-[transform,box-shadow] duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_16px_40px_-24px_rgba(31,127,224,0.5)]"><FeatureIcon icon={PhoneOutgoing} color="green" id="task-follow-up" class="size-14 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:-rotate-3" /><h3 class="mt-3 text-[16px] font-medium">Follow-up</h3><p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-[22px] text-muted">Chama de volta, por mensagem ou ligação, quem sumiu 10 minutos, 1 dia ou 1 semana depois.</p></div><div class="group rounded-[18px] border border-line bg-surface p-5 transition-[transform,box-shadow] duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_16px_40px_-24px_rgba(31,127,224,0.5)]"><FeatureIcon icon={Target} color="pink" id="task-qualificacao" class="size-14 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:-rotate-3" /><h3 class="mt-3 text-[16px] font-medium">Qualificação</h3><p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-[22px] text-muted">Faz as perguntas certas e entrega só os leads quentes pro time.</p></div><div class="group rounded-[18px] border border-line bg-surface p-5 transition-[transform,box-shadow] duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_16px_40px_-24px_rgba(31,127,224,0.5)]"><FeatureIcon icon={Wallet} color="purple" id="task-cobranca" class="size-14 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:-rotate-3" /><h3 class="mt-3 text-[16px] font-medium">Cobrança</h3><p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-[22px] text-muted">Gera Pix e boleto, confirma o pagamento e envia o recibo.</p></div><div class="group rounded-[18px] border border-line bg-surface p-5 transition-[transform,box-shadow] duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_16px_40px_-24px_rgba(31,127,224,0.5)]"><FeatureIcon icon={HeartHandshake} color="blue" id="task-pos-venda" class="size-14 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:-rotate-3" /><h3 class="mt-3 text-[16px] font-medium">Pós-venda</h3><p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-[22px] text-muted">Pede avaliação, envia lembretes e oferece a próxima compra.</p></div><div class="group rounded-[18px] border border-line bg-surface p-5 transition-[transform,box-shadow] duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_16px_40px_-24px_rgba(31,127,224,0.5)]"><FeatureIcon icon={RotateCcw} color="orange" id="task-reativacao" class="size-14 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:-rotate-3" /><h3 class="mt-3 text-[16px] font-medium">Reativação</h3><p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-[22px] text-muted">Reacende a base antiga com ofertas no momento certo.</p></div><div class="group rounded-[18px] border border-line bg-surface p-5 transition-[transform,box-shadow] duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-[0_16px_40px_-24px_rgba(31,127,224,0.5)]"><FeatureIcon icon={Headset} color="green" id="task-suporte" class="size-14 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:-rotate-3" /><h3 class="mt-3 text-[16px] font-medium">Suporte</h3><p class="mt-1 text-[14px] leading-[22px] text-muted">Tira dúvidas com a sua base de conhecimento e escala quando precisa.</p></div></div></div></section>
